  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "JD-GUI 是一个独立运行的 Java 字节码反编译图形化工具，将 .class 文件反编译为可读的 Java 源代码并以图形界面展示。用户可以浏览重构后的源码、跳转到方法和字段、搜索常量池、导出全部源码，支持 JAR/WAR/EAR/APK 等多种容器格式。适用于开发者逆向分析、调试和学习 Java 程序。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "字节码反编译",
        "description": "使用 JD-Core 引擎将 Java 字节码(.class)反编译为可读的 Java 源代码，支持显示行号对齐、Unicode 字符转义等选项",
        "evidence": ["services/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/view/component/ClassFilePage.java:34", "services/build.gradle:6"]
      },
      {
        "name": "图形化浏览界面",
        "description": "基于 Swing 构建的桌面 GUI，包含树形结构浏览、多标签页编辑器、语法高亮、超链接跳转等功能",
        "evidence": ["app/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/view/MainView.java", "services/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/view/component/JavaFilePage.java"]
      },
      {
        "name": "多格式容器支持",
        "description": "支持打开和浏览 JAR、WAR、EAR、APK、AAR、KAR、ZIP 等多种 Java 相关容器格式，自动识别和展示内部结构",
        "evidence": ["services/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/model/container/JarContainer.java", "services/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/model/container/WarContainer.java"]
      },
      {
        "name": "源码导出",
        "description": "支持导出单个文件或整个项目的反编译源码，可选择是否包含行号和元数据信息",
        "evidence": ["app/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/view/SaveAllSourcesView.java", "services/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/service/sourcesaver/"]
      },
      {
        "name": "搜索与导航",
        "description": "提供打开类型、打开类型层次结构、搜索常量池字符串等快速导航功能，便于定位代码",
        "evidence": ["app/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/view/OpenTypeView.java", "app/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/view/SearchInConstantPoolsView.java"]
      },
      {
        "name": "插件扩展机制",
        "description": "通过 SPI 机制支持加载外部扩展插件，可自定义文件加载器、树节点工厂、源码保存器等",
        "evidence": ["api/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/spi/", "app/src/main/java/org/jd/gui/service/extension/ExtensionService.java"]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "开发工具",
    "target_users": "Java 开发者、逆向工程师、调试人员"
  },
